MIGRATION NOTE
--------------
This repository is a presentation-focused migration of the original work
above: the project has been re-titled, re-organised into `data/`, `notebooks/`,
`docs/`, `assets/` and `screenshots/`, notebook data paths have been made
portable, and new documentation and an architecture diagram have been added.

The analytical implementation (EDA, hypothesis testing, logistic regression,
Random Forest / XGBoost modelling), the dataset and the original figures remain
the work of the original author. No new licence is granted by this migration,
and the original all-rights-reserved terms continue to apply in full.

The dataset (`data/tiktok_dataset.csv`) was supplied as course material for the
Google Advanced Data Analytics Professional Certificate programme and is
included here for reproducibility of the published analysis.
